+/// Position::portal_attacks_king() answers whether the king of kingColor is
+/// attacked after the portal move m is made: the victim on the target square is
+/// gone, the mover stands on the twin, and whatever stood on the twin stands on
+/// the target. Used by legal() for the mover's own king and by gives_check() for
+/// the enemy's. Only the three relocated squares are virtual; every other piece
+/// attacks from where it is, through the new occupancy.
